ogramme provided by or under arrangements made pursuant to section 2 of the Employment and

Training Act 1973 (functions of the Secretary of State) or section 2 of the Enterprise and New Towns (Scotland) Act 1990) (functions in relation to training for employment, etc.); or (c) the Employment, Skills and Enterprise Scheme;

