rded under those Regulations either terminated immediately before the relevant date or is still in existence at that date. (3) Any disregard which applies under sub-paragraph (1), (1A) or (2) has effect until the award comes to an end. (4) In this paragraph— “the award”, except in sub-paragraph (2), means— (a) the award of a reduction under the authority’s scheme during which the relevant sum or, where it is paid in more than one instalment, the first instalment of that sum is received; and
